  "learnGlossarySubtitle": "Learn common Islamic terms through short, beginner-friendly explanations you can open any time.",
  "learnGlossaryCardTitle": "Glossary",
  "learnGlossaryCardSubtitle": "Keep common Islamic terms close by while you build your foundations.",
